pute solution; and Uptime for real-time uptime and latency alerts, as well as managed hosting and DigitalOcean Marketplace, a platform where developers can find pre-configured applications and solutions. Further, it offers artificial intelligence (AI)/machine learning (ML) applications comprising GPU droplets; bare metal GPUS, which provides access to a GPU server without any virtualization layer and gives developers with customizable server for their use case; and Jupyter Notebooks that provides cloud workspace and managed interactive development environment for exploring data and training, and building machine learning models. Its customers use its platform in various industry verticals, such as online gaming, fintech, and cybersecurity, as well as for a range of use cases, including building and hosting websites, web and mobile applications development, AI integration, and building AI products and applications. DigitalOcean Holdings, Inc. was incorporated in 2012 and is headquartered in Broomfield, Colorado.","employees":1462,"website":"https://www.digitalocean.com","country":"United States","city":"Broomfield","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Padmanabhan T. Srinivasan","title":"CEO & Director"},{"name":"Mr. W. Matthew Steinfort","title":"Chief Financial Officer"},{"name":"Ms. Cherie  Barrett","title":"Senior VP & Chief Accounting Officer"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":17.48,"tpe":30.05,"ps":4.43,"pfcf":25.99,"peg":1.11,"pb":4.647,"ev_ebitda":18.95,"rev_growth":0.191,"eps_growth":0.356,"eps_growth_fwd":0.2432,"eps_growth_next":0.1809,"div_yield":0,"roe":0.1241,"roa":0.04945,"de":32.8,"gross_margin":0.5312,"op_margin":0.1174,"profit_margin":0.09364,"current_ratio":1.863},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":null,"sector":17.48,"verdict":"—"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":309.6,"sector":30.05,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":9.632,"sector":4.43,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":120.7,"sector":25.99,"verd